(https://community.home-assistant.io/t/ikea-bilresa-scroll-wheel-blueprint-matter/965365,
gist https://gist.github.com/jhol-byte/b2731a4d2476f530d76b9ff409f7f3a4, version 2026-04-06).
That upstream work is published WITHOUT a licence, which under default copyright means its
author reserves all rights. Nothing here grants you rights over the upstream portion, and no
authorship of it is claimed. If jhol-byte adds a licence, it governs those portions and this
notice should be updated.

If you are the upstream author and want this changed or removed, open an issue and it will be
handled promptly.

